@startuml 06-state-loan
' Loan lifecycle — BR-02, BR-03, BR-04, BR-05, BR-07, BR-08, BR-09, BR-10, BR-11, BR-12
[*] --> Requested

' BR-03
Requested --> Waitlisted : T1 review [not equipmentAvailable]
Waitlisted --> Requested : T2 equipmentReleased
' BR-02, BR-12, BR-03 (E18: stock re-checked on approval)
Requested --> Approved : T3 approve [allApprovalsGiven && equipmentAvailable && noOverdueLoans] / notifyBorrower
' BR-04
Requested --> Rejected : T4 reject / recordReason
' BR-08
Requested --> Withdrawn : T5 withdraw / releaseEquipment
Waitlisted --> Withdrawn : T6 withdraw
' BR-08, change 001 (closingReason)
Approved --> Withdrawn : T11 cancel / recordReason
' BR-05, BR-11
Approved --> OnLoan : T7 checkOut [agreementSigned && assetTagsVerified] / recordCheckOutDate
' BR-07
OnLoan --> Overdue : T8 expire [after dueDate]
' FUS7 AC1
OnLoan --> Returned : T9 return / recordReturnDate
' BR-10
Overdue --> Returned : T10 return / chargeLateFee

Rejected --> [*]
Withdrawn --> [*]
Returned --> [*]

' FUS1 AC4, FUS8 AC1
Requested : entry / notifyApprovers
' BR-09
Requested : do / remindPendingApprovers
' BR-02: an approval that leaves others outstanding keeps the loan in Requested
Requested : approve [not allApprovalsGiven] / addApproval
' BR-03, FUS3 AC2
Waitlisted : entry / notifyBorrower
' [用户] 01-rules.md 说明: one day before dueDate (confirmed in 5b)
OnLoan : do / remindBeforeDue
' BR-07
Overdue : entry / notifyBorrowerAndManager
' [用户] 01-rules.md 说明: overdue alerts are marked handled once the loan is returned (confirmed 2026-10-26)
Overdue : exit / closeOverdueAlert
@enduml
